# Keeps visionex-tv/frontend/public/ tracked in git.
#
# Dockerfile line 12 does `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`, which is
# the standard Next.js standalone runner layout. Next.js does not create this
# directory itself, so without a tracked file here the directory does not exist
# in the build context and the image build fails with:
#
#   failed to compute cache key: "/app/public": not found
#
# Delete this file only if you also drop that COPY from the Dockerfile.
